# Every dot-folder stays out: editor tooling (.claude, .remember, ...) drops
# its own here, and none of it has to ship.
.*/**
.vscode/**
.github/**
.git/**
.vscode-test/**
out/**
node_modules/**
src/**
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.yarnrc
.npmrc
esbuild.js
scripts/**
vsc-extension-quickstart.md
**/tsconfig*.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/.vscode-test.*
**/*.map

# Internal documentation and work notes — not for end users.
# Por PATRON y no por nombre: escrito uno a uno, el fichero que se queda fuera
# es siempre el SIGUIENTE (a Atria le paso dos veces con plan.md/plan-inspector.md).
CLAUDE.md
[Pp]lan*.md

# Los .vsix de builds anteriores viven en la raiz; vsce empaqueta el DIRECTORIO.
*.vsix


# The last Lovervoid.bays release (a shell that hands its state over) is
# packaged on its own from its folder.
legacy/**
